NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No machine-learning model weights are included in this repository, and no
default model is downloaded. `triton run --detector onnx --model PATH` loads
whatever the operator supplies.

This matters because many popular detection weights (several YOLO families in
particular) are AGPL-3.0, whose copyleft obligations would conflict with this
project's proprietary licence if shipped or implied. The licence of any weights
you supply is yours to satisfy; this project makes no claim about them.

