NOTE ON FIRMWARE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

firmware/turret_firmware/turret_firmware.ino includes <Servo.h> from the Arduino
core (LGPL-2.1). The sketch is source that you compile yourself against your own
Arduino installation; nothing is redistributed by this project.

